 * 3. Call the boardStatus search endpoint using a random (guaranteed non-matching) UUID
 *    for 'pol_eco_board_board_id' AND/OR a status_type not assigned to any record (if possible)
 * 4. Assert the paginated data array returned is empty and counts are zero (records/pages)
 */
