 * 5. Confirm from the result that the session is marked revoked (revoked:true, revokedAt set, sessionId matches the target).
 * 6. Retrieve the session list again – validate that the revoked session has been removed from active sessions and that the remaining session(s) are still active (i.e., only revoked_at != null for the revoked session if present in audit but no longer in active list).
 * 7. (Edge) Try using the revoked session's tokens to perform an authenticated action (if possible), confirm authentication fails.
