 * 3. Create several appeals using the admin. Each appeal should have unique appellant_id, status, and outcome values for meaningful filtering. At least three distinct test records should be created, each with distinct filtering properties.
 * 4. Use PATCH /polEcoBoard/admin/appeals (index) endpoint to search with filters for appellant_id, status, and outcome.
