 *   - moderator registration/login, then action/audit creation as prerequisites
 *   - an update of the audit succeeds for allowed fields (partial or full IUpdate)
 *   - immutable fields (e.g. pre_state_snapshot, moderation_action_id, auditor_id) cannot be updated
 *   - audit modification attempts by unauthorized (non-moderator) users are rejected
 *   - only changes to permitted fields are reflected in response (others remain unchanged)
 *   - updates are tracked via updated_at field, and pre-modified values persist
 *
