 * 3. Add an initial moderation audit to the action
 * 4. Update audit via permitted IUpdate properties (reason and/or post_state_snapshot)
 * 5. Confirm update is accepted, changed fields reflect new value, unmodifiable fields are unchanged, and updated_at increases
 * 6. Try to update immutable properties (should not succeed)
