 * 9. Member assigns a tag to the new post
 * 10. Attempt to delete the tag assignment from the post as admin *without* authentication (no token) — expect authorization failure
 * 11. Attempt to delete the tag assignment with an invalid/expired token — expect authorization failure
 * 12. (Optional check) Verify the post-tag association still exists (re-query or setup logic)
