 * 1. Register a new admin account
 * 2. Login as admin to establish authentication/authorization
 * 3. Register a new member (target for role transition)
 * 4. Create a role transition (member → moderator, status pending)
 * 5. Update transition: mark as completed and set a new rationale
 * 6. Assert: status/rationale reflect new values, immutable fields/audit trail preserved
 * 7. Negative case: attempt to change immutable field (origin_role) and expect error
