 * 3. As moderator, create a valid moderation action (which will be linked to the escalation).
 * 4. As admin (creator), create an escalation event, supplying all required parameters, referencing the moderation action, assigning as self the recipient, and picking the moderator as escalator.
 * 5. Validate that escalation is successfully created, fields mapped properly, IDs/links established, proper status, rationale/metadata set as expected.
 * 6. Perform negative tests: omit rationale, use invalid moderation action IDs, assign recipient to a user without privileges, and assert appropriate errors are triggered.
